@anon.0df7343c11697ede3e01530902485795.130 = private unnamed_addr constant <{ [80642 x i8] }> <{ [80642 x i8] c"Changelog\0A=========\0A\0A[1.25.2](https://github.com/casey/just/releases/tag/1.25.2) - 2024-03-10\0A------------------------------------------------------------------------\0A\0A- Unpin ctrlc ([#1951](https://github.com/casey/just/pull/1951))\0A\0A[1.25.1](https://github.com/casey/just/releases/tag/1.25.1) - 2024-03-09\0A------------------------------------------------------------------------\0A\0A### Misc\0A- Pin ctrlc to version 3.1.1 ([#1945](https://github.com/casey/just/pull/1945))\0A- Fix AArch64 release build error ([#1942](https://github.com/casey/just/pull/1942))\0A\0A[1.25.0](https://github.com/casey/just/releases/tag/1.25.0) - 2024-03-07\0A------------------------------------------------------------------------\0A\0A### Added\0A- Add `blake3` and `blake3_file` functions ([#1860](https://github.com/casey/just/pull/1860) by [tgross35](https://github.com/tgross35))\0A\0A### Misc\0A- Fix readme typo ([#1936](https://github.com/casey/just/pull/1936) by [Justintime50](https://github.com/Justintime50))\0A- Use unwrap_or_default ([#1928](https://github.com/casey/just/pull/1928))\0A- Set codegen-units to 1 reduce release binary size ([#1920](https://github.com/casey/just/pull/1920) by [amarao](https://github.com/amarao))\0A- Document openSUSE package ([#1918](https://github.com/casey/just/pull/1918) by [sfalken](https://github.com/sfalken))\0A- Fix install.sh shellcheck warnings ([#1912](https://github.com/casey/just/pull/1912) by [tgross35](https://github.com/tgross35))\0A\0A[1.24.0](https://github.com/casey/just/releases/tag/1.24.0) - 2024-02-11\0A------------------------------------------------------------------------\0A\0A### Added\0A- Support recipe paths containing `::` in Bash completion script ([#1863](https://github.com/casey/just/pull/1863) by [crdx](https://github.com/crdx))\0A- Add function to canonicalize paths ([#1859](https://github.com/casey/just/pull/1859))\0A\0A### Misc\0A- Document installing just on Github Actions in readme ([#1867](https://github.com/casey/just/pull/1867) by [cclauss](https://github.com/cclauss))\0A- Use unlikely-to-be-set variable name in env tests ([#1882](https://github.com/casey/just/pull/1882))\0A- Skip write_error test if running as root ([#1881](https://github.com/casey/just/pull/1881))\0A- Convert run_shebang into integration test ([#1880](https://github.com/casey/just/pull/1880))\0A- Install mdbook with cargo in CI workflow ([#1877](https://github.com/casey/just/pull/1877))\0A- Remove deprecated actions-rs/toolchain ([#1874](https://github.com/casey/just/pull/1874) by [cclauss](https://github.com/cclauss))\0A- Fix Gentoo package link ([#1875](https://github.com/casey/just/pull/1875) by [vozbu](https://github.com/vozbu))\0A- Fix typos found by codespell ([#1872](https://github.com/casey/just/pull/1872) by [cclauss](https://github.com/cclauss))\0A- Replace deprecated set-output command in Github Actions workflows ([#1869](https://github.com/casey/just/pull/1869) by [cclauss](https://github.com/cclauss))\0A- Update `actions/checkout` and `softprops/action-gh-release` ([#1871](https://github.com/casey/just/pull/1871) by [app/dependabot](https://github.com/app/dependabot))\0A- Keep GitHub Actions up to date with Dependabot ([#1868](https://github.com/casey/just/pull/1868) by [cclauss](https://github.com/cclauss))\0A- Add contrib directory ([#1870](https://github.com/casey/just/pull/1870))\0A- Fix install script ([#1844](https://github.com/casey/just/pull/1844))\0A\0A[1.23.0](https://github.com/casey/just/releases/tag/1.23.0) - 2024-01-12\0A------------------------------------------------------------------------\0A\0A### Added\0A- Allow setting custom confirm prompt ([#1834](https://github.com/casey/just/pull/1834) by [CramBL](https://github.com/CramBL))\0A- Add `set quiet` and `[no-quiet]` ([#1704](https://github.com/casey/just/pull/1704) by [dharrigan](https://github.com